00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:26.580
in the way that the series is now.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:30.870
And the whole series kinda
started off as a joke,

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.480
of course, the very
first video when I left,

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.400
I was like, okay, part of the joke

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.680
was that I'm an independent YouTuber now,

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.030
I have no idea what's,

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:40.290
I mean, it was-
- I'm a strong,

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:43.920
independent YouTuber.
