I don't understand this.

01:43:33.566 --> 01:43:35.910
This is kind of a weird thing.

01:43:35.910 --> 01:43:39.063
But, you know, they get
there and they're saying,

01:43:40.117 --> 01:43:41.700
"I used to watch "Smosh" all the time,

01:43:41.700 --> 01:43:44.505
I love your stuff."
- You're fucking weird.

01:43:44.505 --> 01:43:46.747
(men laughing)

01:43:46.747 --> 01:43:48.960
- So, anyway, why are you weird?

01:43:48.960 --> 01:43:51.990
- So I very quickly changed my perspective

01:43:51.990 --> 01:43:53.290
with the way that I went
into the interviews.

01:43:53.290 --> 01:43:55.050
Like, there was no way,

01:43:55.050 --> 01:44:00.050
